I graduated from the National Art School in 1981, and have been a practicing artist since then, updating my qualifications regularly and teaching Visual Arts for 27 years in various establishments. These include: TAFE, New England Girls School, regional High Schools, and G.[I] Correctional Centre. I also have a Graduate Diploma in Education from UNE.
My partner and[ I had] an exhibition of our combined work of paintings & leadlights at Maitland Regional Art Gallery in October 2013.
